# THE ADD-ONS BUILD (`npm run build:addons`) IS DESKTOP - Desktop and the Home Server in every
# respect, plus the add-ons' pages from ee/frontend (vite.config.ts). So it is desktop mode here,
# exactly as .env.desktop: one local person, no accounts, every FEATURES.* flag as on Desktop.
VITE_APP_MODE=desktop
# Empty, as in .env.desktop and .env.server - the SPA calls its own origin.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
